        " اَلرَّجُلِ يُوصِي إِلَى اَلرَّجُلِ بِوَصِيَّةٍ فَيَكْرَهُ أَنْ يَقْبَلَهَا فَقَالَ أَبُو عَبْدِ اَللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ \"لاَ يَخْذُلْهُ عَلَى هَذِهِ اَلْحَالِ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5448 - Muhammad ibn Abi Umayr narrated from Hisham ibn Salim from Abu Abdullah (as) regarding a man who is entrusted with a will by another man but dislikes accepting it.\nAbu Abdullah (as) said: \"He should not abandon him in this situation.\""
        ]
      }
